  "content": "<p>這個 [Forge] 模組包包含 23 個以 TNT、炸藥、幸運方塊和機會方塊為基礎的模組。</p><p>玩家的目標是完成幸運方塊競速賽。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fscalacube.com%252fp%252f_hosting_server_minecraft%252f2236249\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://scalacube.com/images/banners/modpack.jpg\" width=\"900\" height=\"194\"></a></p><p>模組清單：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/it-fell-from-the-sky\" rel=\"nofollow\">天降之物 (作者：ohaiiChun)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish 傢俱模組 (作者：MrCrayfish)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughitems\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品數量不足 (作者：Chicken_Bones)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/codechickencore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CodeChickenCore (作者：Chicken_Bones)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero 世界地圖 (作者：xaero96)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\">元素苦力怕 (作者：Lomeli12)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">額外工具 (作者：Forge_User_06804776)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">豐富生態域 (作者：Forstride)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel\" rel=\"nofollow\">鑿刻工藝 (作者：tterrag1098)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">幸運方塊 (作者：player_in_distress)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/much-tnt\" rel=\"nofollow\">過量 TNT (作者：kemot240)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">背包 (作者：Eydamos)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chance-cubes\" rel=\"nofollow\">機會方塊 (作者：TurkeyDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootbags\" rel=\"nofollow\">戰利品袋 (作者：Mina_the_Engineer)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/damage-indicators-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">傷害顯示模組 (作者：rich1051414)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵製儲物箱 (作者：ProgWML6)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-leaf-decay\" rel=\"nofollow\">快速落葉衰變 (作者：olafskiii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apocabucket\" rel=\"nofollow\">末世水桶 (作者：Forge_User_52552646)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">滑鼠調整 (作者：YaLTeR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ichunutil\" rel=\"nofollow\">iChun 工具集 (作者：ohaiiChun)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controlling\" rel=\"nofollow\">控制優化 (作者：Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero 小地圖 (作者：xaero96)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hats\" rel=\"nofollow\">帽子模組 (作者：ohaiiChun)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
